ur inner rockstar in hyper-realistic VR. Lots of head-banging tracks, dynamic environments, and multiplayer battles, this is rhythm gaming reborn.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 KEY FEATURES\n\n\ud83e\udd41 REALISTIC DRUMMING: Experience lifelike drum physics & haptic feedback \u2013 crafted for Meta Quest 3!\n\n\ud83c\udf1f LOTS OF ROCK/EDM TRACKS: Master classics from Metallica to Skrillex, with 5 difficulties & 360\u00b0 modes.\n\n\ud83d\udca5 SMASH TO WIN: Hit the right rhythm a lot to create many fuels explosive combos!\n\n\ud83d\ude80 WHY DRUMMERS LOVE IT:\n\"Finally, a VR game that makes you SWEAT! The adrenaline rush is unreal!\"", "short_description": "Smash drums in explosive VR! Feel real beats, master rock songs & become a rhythm legend. Play now!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/seivr/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jone Sei", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/seivr/games", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24218172534516274"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 10, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1363455412265378"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1501161478034062"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1279773064066744"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED",